## Project context

- This repo is primarily an Expo React Native app located in `VoiceJournal/`.
- Treat `VoiceJournal/` as the default working directory for app changes.
- Generated native projects (`VoiceJournal/android`, `VoiceJournal/ios`) are outputs of `expo prebuild`; avoid manual edits unless explicitly required.

## Commands (source of truth)

- Install: `cd VoiceJournal && npm install`
- Typecheck: `cd VoiceJournal && npm run typecheck`
- Tests: `cd VoiceJournal && npm test` (or `npm run test:smoke`)
- Android build: `cd VoiceJournal && npm run build:android`
